00:04:03.836 --> 00:04:09.276
the United States will buy Russian diesel. That same runway into Thursday is where Washington and

00:04:09.276 --> 00:04:16.016
two European allies are arguing about how Ukraine fights. CNBC reports the clash. At NATO headquarters

00:04:16.016 --> 00:04:21.396
