00:04:21.396 --> 00:04:26.196
look like a spectacle. They have not ended the war and they have not slowed Russia at the front.

00:04:26.776 --> 00:04:30.816
He said hits he treats as civilian. He named the retailer Wildberries,

00:04:31.256 --> 00:04:34.896
have probably stiffened Russian opinion and the Kremlin's will to escalate.

00:04:35.416 --> 00:04:38.736
