00:04:53.996 --> 00:04:58.816
German Defense Minister Boris Pistorius said attacking criticism at strikes on strategic

00:04:58.816 --> 00:05:04.356
military and military-use targets is quite a stupid thing, and that the strikes worth condemning

00:05:04.356 --> 00:05:09.436
are Russia's nightly hits on Ukraine's energy, water, and heat, which he called terrorism.

00:05:10.096 --> 00:05:15.016
Britain's west-streeting said it is not for outsiders to tell Ukraine how to fight, and

00:05:15.016 --> 00:05:19.756
