00:05:41.536 --> 00:05:45.396
They do not, in these remarks, say deep strikes by themselves will end the war.

00:05:46.016 --> 00:05:50.836
By the end of Thursday, the check is whether Trump, Xi, and Putin put out any shared line

00:05:50.836 --> 00:05:53.336
