00:12:10.223 --> 00:12:13.483
like proof that climate policy and output cannot share a year.

00:12:14.223 --> 00:12:18.723
Deutscheweller reports Earth has already crossed seven of nine planetary boundaries treated

00:12:18.723 --> 00:12:23.923
