00:12:30.363 --> 00:12:35.803
green growth as business as usual with more sustainable tools, wind and solar instead

00:12:35.803 --> 00:12:42.503
of coal and gas, heat pumps instead of gas furnaces, and more reuse of materials. With colleagues

00:12:42.503 --> 00:12:47.903
