00:12:47.903 --> 00:12:52.863
nation's intergovernmental panel on climate change, show output can keep rising while

00:12:52.863 --> 00:12:58.243
emissions from coal, oil, and gas fall hard. And Deutschewelle says that Split has already

00:12:58.243 --> 00:13:04.023
run for years in the United Kingdom, the United States, Japan, and Australia, even counting

00:13:04.023 --> 00:13:09.363
offshore production. In the European Union, the economy has grown more than 70 percent since

00:13:09.363 --> 00:13:15.383
