00:13:26.203 --> 00:13:31.143
path for avoiding the worst climate damage. Stealing chemicals are tougher because carbon

00:13:31.143 --> 00:13:36.523
sits in the chemistry, not only in the furnace, and stand in such as green hydrogen take

00:13:36.523 --> 00:13:42.343
heavy investment. Cheaper clean production can also rebound. Firms and households use more,

00:13:42.343 --> 00:13:48.663
